I put it on the calendar.

299
00:08:06,620 --> 00:08:07,420
The first week,

300
00:08:07,420 --> 00:08:08,250
I couldn't have told

301
00:08:08,250 --> 00:08:09,760
you if anything was
happening.

302
00:08:09,820 --> 00:08:10,750
I tried not to get

303
