surgery is over.

332
00:08:56,740 --> 00:08:57,330
Two.

333
00:08:57,630 --> 00:08:59,520
Inflamed tissue holds
extra fluid,

334
00:08:59,520 --> 00:09:00,390
so it takes up more

335
00:09:00,390 --> 00:09:01,440
