336
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:02,120
Three.

337
00:09:02,160 --> 00:09:03,750
There's only so much room
in there.

338
00:09:03,790 --> 00:09:05,260
Bending compresses it.

339
00:09:05,500 --> 00:09:07,250
Straightening pulls it
tight.

340
00:09:07,420 --> 00:09:08,690
That's the squeeze.

341
00:09:08,730 --> 00:09:09,420
Four.

342
00:09:09,640 --> 00:09:11,910
Red and near-infrared
light have been

343
00:09:11,910 --> 00:09:14,270
