346
00:09:17,160 --> 00:09:18,360
In a randomized trial,

347
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:20,290
patients given light
therapy

348
00:09:20,290 --> 00:09:22,770
after a knee replacement
had less pain,

349
00:09:22,770 --> 00:09:24,530
