early

350
00:09:24,530 --> 00:09:26,440
movement than those who
weren't.

351
00:09:26,650 --> 00:09:29,400
A 2025 review said the
same,

352
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:30,490
and was clear the evidence

353
00:09:30,490 --> 00:09:31,450
