357
00:09:35,580 --> 00:09:37,270
But after two years of
doing everything

358
00:09:37,270 --> 00:09:39,110
I was told and getting
nowhere,

359
00:09:39,110 --> 00:09:40,330
you have no idea what it's

360
00:09:40,330 --> 00:09:41,750
like to sleep through the
night,

361
00:09:41,750 --> 00:09:43,210
say yes to the walk,

362
00:09:43,210 --> 00:09:44,600
and get my life back.

363
00:09:44,640 --> 00:09:45,830
So take it from me.

364
00:09:45,870 --> 00:09:47,150
Don't spend another year
waiting

365
00:09:47,150 --> 00:09:48,070
